<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any condition, stipulation or provision in a franchise agreement purporting to bind a franchisee to waive compliance with any provision of this Act is void."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This section shall not prevent any person from entering into a settlement agreement or executing a general release regarding a potential or actual civil action filed in respect of the franchise nor shall it prevent the arbitration of any claim."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
