<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://schema.org/name> "The registration of a franchise shall continue to be"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "effective unless the Registrar issues an order made by written notice to the applicant or the franchisor to suspend, terminate, prohibit or deny the sale or registration of the franchise under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
