<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "If there is any material change in the disclosure documents mentioned in paragraphs 7( 1 ) ( a) and (f), the applicant or his director or manager shall amend the documents according to the prescribed form."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
