<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The documents in subsection (1) shall be filed with the Registrar."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
