<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar may, at any time, require additional information on the amendments made under this section."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
