<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A franchisor may, at any time after the franchise term, apply to the Registrar for cancellation of the registration of the franchise from the register."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
