<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar shall accordingly cancel the registration of the franchise from the register if he is satisfied that the franchisor is no longer granting rights under the franchise."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
