<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar may impose conditions on the registration of a franchise broker."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The conditions in subsection (3) may include conditions governing the sale of a franchise by a franchise broker and conditions on the conduct, suspension, termination, prohibition or denial of registration of a franchise broker."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
