<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A franchisor and a franchisee shall act in an honest and lawful manner and shall endeavour to pursue the best franchise business practice of the time and place."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
