<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_I__cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "\"advertisement\" means any publication, circular, notice, or any oral or written communication, whether broadcasted by electronic or any other publishing media, or any form of electronic communications to the public for the purpose of offering the sale of a franchise or promoting the sale of a franchise; \"authorised officer\" means an officer authorised in writing by the Minister under section 42 to exercise the powers of enforcement under this Act; \"disclosure documents\" means such disclosure documents as may be prescribed by the Minister; \"franchise\" means a contract or an agreement, either expressed or implied, whether oral or written, between two or more persons by which—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
