<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the franchisor grants to the the franchisee the right to use a mark, or a trade secret, or any confidential information or intellectual property, owned by the franchisor or relating to the franchisor, and includes a situation where the franchisor, who is the registered user of, or is licensed by another person to use, any intellectual property, grants such right that he possesses to permit the franchisee to use the intellectual property;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
