<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "the franchisor has the responsibility to provide assistance to the franchisee to operate his business including such assistance as the provision or supply of materials and services, training, marketing, and business or technical assistance;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
