<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
