<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who wishes to publish, distribute or use any advertisement offering to sell or to buy a franchise under this Act shall file with the Registrar one original copy of the advertisement at least five days before the first publication, distribution or use of the advertisement or such shorter period as may be approved by the Registrar, or unless the advertisement has been exempted from this section by the Registrar."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
