<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar may, by order, prohibit the use of any advertising deemed to be false, fraudulent, misleading or deceptive."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
