<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "46" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
