<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46> <https://schema.org/name> "No female person shall be searched under section 44"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46> <https://schema.org/text> "or 45 except by another female person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
