<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_47> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_47> <https://schema.org/name> "An authorised officer conducting a search under section"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_47> <https://schema.org/text> "44 or 45 or shall be given access to computerised data whether stored in a computer or otherwise."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_48> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_48__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_48> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VII__cl_48__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
