<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An offer under subsection (1) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed, but before any prosecution for it has been instituted."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
