<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If an offence has been compounded under subsection (1), no prosecution shall be instituted in respect of the offence against the person to whom the offer to compound was made."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/eng@> .
